---
import SectionTitle from '../SectionTitle.astro'

const { class: className } = Astro.props

const totalYears = new Date().getFullYear() - 2018
---

<section class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:gap-4">
  <SectionTitle title="About Me" />
  <h2
    class:list={[
      'text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty',
      className,
    ]}
  >
    Self-taught engineer, shipping for {totalYears}+ years across startups,
    client work, and my own products. My range runs from React & Flutter apps
    to smart contracts on EVM and Solana, LLM platforms and cost-aware AI
    pipelines, payment & metering systems, self-hosted analytics, and the
    infrastructure it all runs on. I'm at my best owning a whole system end to
    end (design, build, deploy, operate) and I've done it solo for products
    handling real users and real money.
  </h2>
</section>
